<title>HONG KONG: UBS sets call warrants on Hutchison.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on Hutchison.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland, Hong Kong Branch said it intended to issue 100 million American-style call warrants on shares of Hutchison Whampoa Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$67.10	 PREMIUM	   21.2 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.6832	GEARING	   8.9x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  07.JAN.98	EXER LOT	  10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	SETTLEMENT DATE 24.JAN.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$61	    LISTING DATE    29.JAN.97</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
